{"seq":2,"slug":"music-theory","title":"音乐理论与欣赏","stage":"DONE","category":"creative-arts","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory","rating":{"composite":3.5,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.28,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"音乐理论与声音艺术\">音乐理论与声音艺术</h1><h2 id=\"hub-定位\">Hub 定位</h2><p>本 Hub 聚焦音乐的内在语言——从旋律、和声、节奏等基础语汇到曲式结构、风格流派和现代录音制作技术。与同 category 下的「视觉艺术基础」侧重造型与色彩、「电影语言」侧重视听叙事不同，本 Hub 专注于纯粹的声音维度：如何理解、分析和创造音乐。与「表演艺术」的边界在于，本 Hub 关注音乐作为知识体系的理论层面，而非舞台实践与表演诠释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本 Hub 包含四个章节，建议按顺序推进：</p>\n<p><strong>第一章「旋律与和声」</strong> 讲解音乐最核心的两个维度——横向的旋律线条和纵向的和声色彩。涵盖音程与音阶体系、旋律构造原则、三和弦与七和弦的结构、和弦功能与进行逻辑，以及对位法的基本原理。这是理解一切音乐作品的基础语汇。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章「节奏与结构」</strong> 聚焦音乐的时间维度——从节奏的基本概念（拍值、节奏型、切分）到拍号与速度的运用，再到音乐曲式的宏观结构（二段体、三段体、回旋曲式、奏鸣曲式），帮助学习者把握音乐作品在时间中展开的组织逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章「音乐流派与历史」</strong> 以时间线和风格为线索，梳理从巴洛克到古典到浪漫再到二十世纪音乐的西方古典传统，以及爵士、摇滚、电子音乐等流行音乐流派的演化脉络和世界各地民族音乐的独特体系。理论知识在这里与具体作品和时代语境结合，形成活的音乐认知。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章「声音与制作」</strong> 进入现代音乐的技术维度——声学基础（频率、泛音、共振）、录音技术原理、混音与母带处理的基本概念，以及数字音频工作站（DAW）的工作流程。这一章将音乐从纯理论拓展到可操作的制作实践。</p>\n<p>前两章是核心基础，建议严格顺序学习；第三章和第四章相对独立，可根据兴趣侧重选择，但第四章的声学内容与前两章的理论知识相互印证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>无需乐器演奏基础或识谱能力，学习过程中会自然建立</li>\n<li>对音乐有好奇心和日常聆听习惯是最佳起点</li>\n<li>了解基本的物理学波动概念有助于理解第四章的声学部分，但非必需</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../performing-arts/\">表演艺术</a> — 音乐表演的舞台实践、即兴与诠释维度</li>\n<li><a href=\"../aesthetics/\">美学</a> — 从哲学角度理解音乐美感的本质和审美体验</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"melody-harmony","title":"旋律与和声","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/melody-harmony","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"melody-fundamentals","title":"旋律基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/melody-harmony/melody-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"harmony-basics","title":"和声基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/melody-harmony/harmony-basics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chord-progressions","title":"和弦进行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/melody-harmony/chord-progressions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"counterpoint","title":"对位法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/melody-harmony/counterpoint"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rhythm-and-structure","title":"节奏与结构","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/rhythm-and-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rhythm-fundamentals","title":"节奏基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/rhythm-and-structure/rhythm-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"meter-and-tempo","title":"拍号与速度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/rhythm-and-structure/meter-and-tempo"},{"seq":3,"slug":"arrangement-basics","title":"编曲基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/rhythm-and-structure/arrangement-basics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"musical-form","title":"曲式结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/rhythm-and-structure/musical-form"},{"seq":5,"slug":"musical-form","title":"音乐曲式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/rhythm-and-structure/musical-form"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"music-genres-and-history","title":"音乐流派与历史","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/music-genres-and-history","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-music","title":"古典音乐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/music-genres-and-history/classical-music"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modern-popular-music","title":"现代流行音乐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/music-genres-and-history/modern-popular-music"},{"seq":3,"slug":"world-music","title":"世界音乐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/music-genres-and-history/world-music"},{"seq":4,"slug":"music-technology","title":"音乐技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/creative-arts/music-theory/music-genres-and-history/music-technology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"sound-and-production","title":"声音与制作","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-boo